n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  identity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  operation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  inverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">a,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> modularGroup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  identity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  operation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  inverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>群的阶</strong>是群中元素的个数 |G|。<strong>元素的阶</strong>是使 aⁿ = e 的最小正整数 n。<strong>Lagrange 定理</strong>：有限群中，子群的阶整除群的阶。推论：元素的阶整除群的阶。</p>\n<p>Lagrange 定理在密码学中有重要应用。<strong>费马小定理</strong> aᵖ⁻¹ ≡ 1 (mod p)（p 为素数且 p ∤ a）就是 Lagrange 定理在 ℤₚ* 上的特例。它被用于 RSA 加密的正确性证明和素性检测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"群在编程中的应用\">群在编程中的应用</h2><p><strong>快速幂</strong>（Binary Exponentiation）利用群运算的结合律，将 aⁿ 的计算从 O(n) 优化到 O(log n)。这个技巧适用于任何满足结合律的运算——数值乘法、矩阵乘法、字符串重复。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function power&lt;T&gt;(group: Omit&lt;Group&lt;T&gt;, &#39;inverse&#39;&gt;, a: T, n: number): T {&#10;  if (n === 0) return group.identity;&#10;  let result = group.identity;&#10;  let base = a;&#10;  while (n &gt; 0) {&#10;    if (n % 2 === 1) result = group.operation(result, base);&#10;    base = group.operation(base, base);&#10;    n = Math.floor(n / 2);&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> power</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">group</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Omit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inverse'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group.identity;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group.identity;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">operation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result, base);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">operation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(base, base);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>矩阵快速幂</strong>是快速幂的经典应用。斐波那契数列的矩阵形式 [[1,1],[1,0]]ⁿ 可以在 O(log n) 次矩阵乘法内计算 F(n)。这在竞赛编程和大规模计算中非常有用。</p>\n<p><strong>对称性分析</strong>：Burnside 引理利用群论计算&quot;不考虑对称性的本质不同方案数&quot;。例如，用 k 种颜色给正方体的面着色，考虑旋转对称后的不同方案数可以通过旋转群（24 个元素）来计算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 群论应用&#10;        A[快速幂]&#10;        B[矩阵快速幂]&#10;        C[Burnside 引理]&#10;        D[密码学]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 核心性质&#10;        E[结合律]&#10;        F[逆元]&#10;        G[Lagrange 定理]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    subgraph 群论应用\n        A[快速幂]\n        B[矩阵快速幂]\n        C[Burnside 引理]\n        D[密码学]\n    end\n    subgraph 核心性质\n        E[结合律]\n        F[逆元]\n        G[Lagrange 定理]\n    end\n    A --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; G\n    D --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"环与域\">环与域</h2><p><strong>环</strong> (R, +, ×) 有两个运算，满足：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(R, +) 是阿贝尔群</li>\n<li>(R, ×) 是半群（封闭、结合）</li>\n<li>分配律：a×(b+c) = a×b + a×c</li>\n</ul>\n<p>(ℤ, +, ×) 是最基本的环。多项式环 ℤ[x] 中的元素是整数系数多项式。矩阵环 M_n(ℝ) 中的元素是 n×n 实数矩阵。注意乘法不一定满足交换律（矩阵乘法不交换），也不一定每个非零元素有逆元。</p>\n<p><strong>域</strong> (F, +, ×) 是乘法也满足交换律且每个非零元素都有乘法逆元的环。域是最&quot;完美&quot;的代数结构——可以做加减乘除所有运算。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有理数域</strong> (ℚ, +, ×)</li>\n<li><strong>实数域</strong> (ℝ, +, ×)</li>\n<li><strong>有限域</strong> GF(p) = (ℤₚ, +, ×)，p 为素数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有限域 GF(p) 在密码学和编码理论中极为重要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>域</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GF(2)</td>\n<td>二进制运算、XOR 加密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GF(2⁸)</td>\n<td>AES 加密的 S-box</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GF(p), p 大素数</td>\n<td>椭圆曲线密码学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GF(2ⁿ)</td>\n<td>Reed-Solomon 纠错码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>GF(2)</strong> 是最简单的域：{0, 1}，加法是 XOR（异或），乘法是 AND（与）。这就是为什么 XOR 运算在密码学中如此重要——它是 GF(2) 上的加法，满足群的所有性质（可逆、结合、交换）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代数结构在类型系统中的体现\">代数结构在类型系统中的体现</h2><p>函数式编程语言中的类型类（Type Class）直接编码了代数结构的概念。</p>\n<p>Haskell 中 <code>Monoid</code> 类型类对应幺半群：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Monoid&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  empty: T;&#10;  concat: (a: T, b: T) =&gt; T;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const stringMonoid: Monoid&lt;string&gt; = {&#10;  empty: &#39;&#39;,&#10;  concat: (a, b) =&gt; a + b,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const arrayMonoid = &lt;T&gt;(): Monoid&lt;T[]&gt; =&gt; ({&#10;  empty: [],&#10;  concat: (a, b) =&gt; [...a, ...b],&#10;});&#10;&#10;const sumMonoid: Monoid&lt;number&gt; = {&#10;  empty: 0,&#10;  concat: (a, b) =&gt; a + b,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Monoid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  empty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  concat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stringMonoid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Monoid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  empty: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  concat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> arrayMonoid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Monoid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  empty: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  concat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">a, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sumMonoid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Monoid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  empty: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  concat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>幺半群的价值在于：任何满足 Monoid 接口的类型都可以使用 <code>reduce</code> 进行聚合。这就是 MapReduce 框架的数学基础——Map 阶段产生值，Reduce 阶段用幺半群运算聚合。</p>\n<p><code>Functor</code>（函子）、<code>Monad</code>（单子）等范畴论概念也是代数结构在类型系统中的推广。理解这些抽象可以帮助程序员写出更通用、更可组合的代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((代数结构))&#10;    群&#10;      封闭+结合+单位元+逆元&#10;      阿贝尔群&#10;      Lagrange 定理&#10;    应用&#10;      快速幂&#10;      矩阵快速幂&#10;      Burnside 引理&#10;    环与域&#10;      整数环&#10;      有限域 GF p&#10;      多项式环&#10;    编程对应&#10;      Monoid 类型类&#10;      MapReduce&#10;      XOR 运算&#10;    密码学&#10;      费马小定理&#10;      RSA&#10;      椭圆曲线\">mindmap\n  root((代数结构))\n    群\n      封闭+结合+单位元+逆元\n      阿贝尔群\n      Lagrange 定理\n    应用\n      快速幂\n      矩阵快速幂\n      Burnside 引理\n    环与域\n      整数环\n      有限域 GF p\n      多项式环\n    编程对应\n      Monoid 类型类\n      MapReduce\n      XOR 运算\n    密码学\n      费马小定理\n      RSA\n      椭圆曲线</pre><ul>\n<li>代数结构（半群→幺半群→群→环→域）形成层次递进的公理系统</li>\n<li>群的结合律使快速幂优化成为可能，将 O(n) 降到 O(log n)</li>\n<li>Lagrange 定理和费马小定理是密码学（RSA、素性检测）的理论基础</li>\n<li>有限域 GF(p) 是密码学和纠错码的数学基础，GF(2) 的加法就是 XOR</li>\n<li>幺半群在编程中对应 Monoid 接口，是 reduce/fold 和 MapReduce 的数学基础</li>\n<li>理解代数结构帮助识别运算的共同模式，写出更抽象和可复用的代码</li>\n<li>置换群连接了代数和组合数学，Burnside 引理是对称性计数的核心工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代数结构","id":"代数结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"群的定义与性质","id":"群的定义与性质"},{"level":2,"text":"群在编程中的应用","id":"群在编程中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"环与域","id":"环与域"},{"level":2,"text":"代数结构在类型系统中的体现","id":"代数结构在类型系统中的体现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"整除性与模运算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/number-theory/divisibility-and-modular"},"next":null}